#: about.html
msgid ""
"Most of that engineering was invisible. The aqueducts ran underground and unremarkable for miles, and the arches everyone photographs exist only because a valley got in the way. The Nîmes aqueduct fell about twelve metres across fifty kilometres — a slope you could not see standing next to it, held steady over every kind of ground in between."
msgstr ""
"大部分工程都是隐形的。输水渠在地下延伸数英里，不引人注目，而大家拍照的拱门只因山谷阻碍才存在。尼姆输水渠在五十公里内下降了大约十二米——站在旁边你根本看不出坡度，它在各种地形上都保持着稳定。"

#: about.html
msgid ""
"No megacorp behind this and no support queue in front of it. File an issue and you are talking to the person who wrote the line. That is the whole advantage, and it is why the roadmap is public."
msgstr "这背后没有大型企业，前面也没有支持队列。提交一个问题，你就能直接和写代码的人对话。这就是全部优势，也是路线图公开的原因。"

#. meta twitter:description
#: about.html
msgid ""
"One person in Spain, tools that would not talk, and an agent that reads all of them. Open source, MIT, so you can read it back."
msgstr "一个人在西班牙，工具之间无法通信，而一个智能体能读取所有这些工具。开源，MIT 许可，所以你可以回溯阅读。"

#: about.html
msgid "One person, in Spain"
msgstr "一个人，在西班牙"

#: about.html open-source.html partials/footer-expanded.html partials/nav-home.html partials/nav-simple.html
msgid "Open source"
msgstr "开源"

#: about.html
msgid ""
"Paste a URL. Duct crawls the site, reads the technical and content signals, and hands back a prioritized report. It is the <0>free front door</0>: no account needed to run one."
msgstr "粘贴一个 URL。Duct 会抓取网站，读取技术和内容信号，然后返回一份优先排序的报告。这是<0>免费的入口</0>：无需账户即可运行。"

#: about.html
msgid "Principles, not <0>platitudes</0>"
msgstr "原则，而非<0>陈词滥调</0>"

