#: integrations/ga4.html
msgid ""
"A Duct session: asked why activation dropped after an Android release, Duct reads GA4, Clarity and Stripe, finds the permission dead end and proposes two GA4 key events"
msgstr ""
"一次 Duct 会话：在 Android 发布后，Duct 被问及为何激活量下降，它读取了 GA4、Clarity 和 Stripe 的数据，找到了权限死胡同，并提出了两个 GA4 关键事件。"

