#: integrations/google-ads.html
msgid ""
"A Duct session: asked where the ads budget is leaking, Duct reads Google Ads campaigns and search terms beside GA4 and Stripe, proposes a pause, two negatives and a budget raise, and writes the spend brief"
msgstr ""
"一次 Duct 运行：询问广告预算流失在哪里，Duct 读取 Google Ads 广告系列和搜索词，同时参考 GA4 和 Stripe，建议暂停、添加两个否定关键词和提高预算，并撰写支出简报"

#: integrations/google-ads.html
