#: integrations/google-ads.html
msgid ""
"Ask where the budget leaks. Duct costs every campaign against your CPA target and proposes the pause, the negatives and the budget shift. The one over the guardrail waits for you."
msgstr "询问预算流失在哪里。Duct 根据你的 CPA 目标计算每个广告系列的成本，并建议暂停、添加否定关键词和调整预算。越过护栏的那个（变更）等待你的操作。"

#: integrations/google-ads.html
msgid "Can Duct change my Google Ads without asking?"
msgstr "Duct 可以在未经我同意的情况下更改我的 Google Ads 吗？"

#: integrations/google-ads.html
msgid ""
"Change a shared budget and every campaign on it changes too. The preview says how many campaigns before you apply."
msgstr "更改共享预算，其上的每个广告系列也会随之更改。在你应用之前，预览会显示影响多少个广告系列。"

#: integrations/google-ads.html
msgid "Connect Google Ads <0>in three steps</0>"
msgstr "连接 Google Ads <0>分三步</0>"

#: integrations/google-ads.html
msgid "Device performance"
msgstr "设备表现"

#: integrations/google-ads.html
msgid "Does it work with a manager (MCC) account?"
msgstr "它是否适用于经理 (MCC) 账号？"

#: integrations/google-ads.html
msgid ""
"Duct joins your campaigns and search terms with GA4 and Stripe, then proposes the change. Eight kinds of change, and each one waits for your Apply."
msgstr "Duct 将你的广告系列和搜索词与 GA4 和 Stripe 关联起来，然后建议变更。八种变更，每一种都等待你的应用。"

#. meta description
#: integrations/google-ads.html
msgid ""
"Duct reads Google Ads beside GA4 and Stripe, finds the spend that never paid, and proposes the fix: negatives, budgets, bids. Nothing runs until you Apply."
msgstr ""
"Duct 读取 Google Ads，同时参考 GA4 和 Stripe，找出从未带来付费的支出，并建议修复方案：否定关键词、预算、出价。在你应用之前，任何操作都不会运行。"

#: integrations/google-ads.html
msgid "Eight kinds of change"
msgstr "八种变更"

#: integrations/google-ads.html
msgid ""
"Eight: add negative keywords, pause campaign, set campaign status, set ad group status, set keyword status, add keywords, set campaign daily budget and set campaign bidding (tCPA/tROAS). By default each one waits for your Apply, and every one can be rolled back."
msgstr ""
"八种：添加否定关键词、暂停广告系列、设置广告系列状态、设置广告组状态、设置关键词状态、添加关键词、设置广告系列每日预算和设置广告系列出价 (tCPA/tROAS)。默认情况下，每种变更都等待你的应用，并且每一种都可以回滚。"

#: integrations/google-ads.html
msgid "Every platform claims the same sale."
msgstr "每个平台都声称是同一个销售。"

#: integrations/google-ads.html
msgid "Fields audited Aug 29, 2026"
msgstr "字段审计日期：2026 年 8 月 29 日"

#. meta twitter:description
#: integrations/google-ads.html
msgid ""
"Find the Google Ads spend that never became revenue, then fix it with one click you control."
msgstr "找出从未转化为收入的 Google Ads 支出，然后通过你控制的一次点击来修复它。"

#: integrations/google-ads.html
msgid "GA4 sees 60% of my Ads clicks. Is auto-tagging broken?"
msgstr "GA4 看到我 60% 的 Ads 点击。自动标记是否已损坏？"

#: integrations/google-ads.html
msgid "Geographic performance"
msgstr "地域表现"

#. meta og:title
#. meta twitter:title
#: integrations/google-ads.html
msgid "Google Ads AI agent that waits for your Apply"
msgstr "等待你应用的 Google Ads AI 智能体"

#: integrations/google-ads.html
msgid "Google Ads AI agent that waits for your Apply | Duct"
msgstr "等待你应用的 Google Ads AI 智能体 | Duct"

#: integrations/google-ads.html
msgid "Google Ads API v23 · fields audited Aug 29, 2026 · <0>read the source</0>"
msgstr "Google Ads API v23 · 字段审计日期：2026 年 8 月 29 日 · <0>阅读源代码</0>"

#: integrations/google-ads.html
msgid ""
"Google Ads cannot bring back a removed campaign, ad group or keyword. Duct only proposes a pause, which rolls back."
msgstr "Google Ads 无法恢复已移除的广告系列、广告组或关键词。Duct 只建议暂停，暂停可以回滚。"

#: integrations/google-ads.html
msgid ""
"Google Ads offers one API permission, and it includes making changes; there is no read-only option. Duct's limit is in its code instead: the agent has no tool that approves a change, so the most it can do is propose one."
msgstr ""
"Google Ads 提供一种 API 权限，其中包括进行更改；没有只读选项。Duct 的限制在于其代码：智能体没有批准变更的工具，因此它最多只能提出建议。"

#. meta og:description
#: integrations/google-ads.html
msgid ""
"Google Ads read next to GA4 and Stripe. Eight kinds of change, each proposed with what it touches and rolled back on request."
msgstr "Google Ads 与 GA4 和 Stripe 一起读取。八种变更，每种都附带其影响范围，并可根据请求回滚。"

#: integrations/google-ads.html
msgid "Google Ads says 120 conversions. How many of them paid?"
msgstr "Google Ads 显示 120 次转化。其中有多少是付费的？"

#: integrations/google-ads.html
msgid "Google Ads, <0>answered</0>"
msgstr "Google Ads，<0>已解答</0>"

#: integrations/google-ads.html
msgid "Google Ads, <0>read next to your revenue.</0>"
msgstr "Google Ads，<0>与你的收入一起读取。</0>"

#: integrations/google-ads.html
msgid ""
"Google counts the last click, Meta counts a seven-day click and a one-day view, and both count the same purchase. Duct checks the total against Stripe."
msgstr "Google 统计最后一次点击，Meta 统计七天点击和一天浏览，两者都统计相同的购买。Duct 会对照 Stripe 检查总数。"

#: integrations/google-ads.html
msgid ""
"Google's own tools see Google Ads. Duct reads Google Ads beside GA4 and Stripe, so it can say which campaigns bring customers who pay, and it reads Meta, Apple and ChatGPT ads the same way."
msgstr ""
"Google 自己的工具能看到 Google Ads。Duct 会同时读取 Google Ads、GA4 和 Stripe 的数据，因此它可以判断哪些广告系列带来了付费客户，并且它以同样的方式读取 Meta、Apple 和 ChatGPT 广告的数据。"

#: integrations/google-ads.html
msgid "How is this different from the AI inside Google Ads?"
msgstr "这与 Google Ads 内置的 AI 有何不同？"

#: integrations/google-ads.html
msgid ""
"If someone changes the budget, bid or status after you approved, Duct refuses to apply over it."
msgstr "如果你批准后有人更改了预算、出价或状态，Duct 会拒绝覆盖这些更改。"

#: integrations/google-ads.html
msgid "In Duct, open the Toolbox and choose Google Ads."
msgstr "在 Duct 中，打开工具箱并选择 Google Ads。"

#: integrations/google-ads.html
msgid ""
"Not by default. Every change is a proposal that shows what it touches, and it runs when you press Apply. If you switch a project to assisted mode, adding keywords and negative keywords can apply on their own; budgets, bids and statuses always wait for you."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下不会。每次更改都是一个提案，会显示它影响的内容，并在你按下应用时运行。如果你将项目切换到辅助模式，添加关键词和否定关键词可以自动应用；预算、出价和状态始终会等待你的批准。"

#: integrations/google-ads.html
