msgstr "Duct 可以在 Google Ads 中进行哪些更改？"

#: integrations/google-ads.html
msgid "Which search terms spend money and never become a paying customer?"
msgstr "哪些搜索词花费了金钱但从未带来付费客户？"

#: integrations/google-ads.html
msgid ""
"Yes. Add the manager account's ID when you connect, and Duct reads the client accounts under it."
msgstr "是的。连接时添加经理账户的 ID，Duct 会读取其下的客户账户。"

#: integrations/google-ads.html
msgid "Your approval is for the number you saw."
msgstr "你的批准是针对你看到的数字。"

