#. img alt
#: integrations/google-search-console.html
msgid ""
"A Duct session: asked why organic trials are flat while impressions rise, Duct reads Search Console queries and query by page beside GA4 and finds two pages splitting the same queries"
msgstr ""
"一次 Duct 运行：当被问及为什么自然试用量持平而展示量却在上升时，Duct 读取了 Search Console 的查询和按页面查询数据以及 GA4 数据，发现有两个页面正在争夺相同的查询。"

#: integrations/google-search-console.html
msgid ""
"Ask why impressions rose and trials didn't. Duct reads query by page, finds two of your pages splitting one query, and joins it to trials in GA4."
msgstr "询问为什么展示量上升而试用量没有。Duct 读取按页面查询数据，发现你的两个页面正在争夺一个查询，并将其与 GA4 中的试用数据关联起来。"

#: integrations/google-search-console.html
msgid "Can Duct change anything in Search Console?"
msgstr "Duct 可以在 Search Console 中进行任何更改吗？"

#: integrations/google-search-console.html
msgid "Connect Search Console <0>in three steps</0>"
msgstr "三步 <0>连接 Search Console</0>"

#: integrations/google-search-console.html
msgid ""
"Duct has no Search Console change operation, so it cannot edit anything in Search Console. It can still recommend a change for you to make there."
msgstr ""
"Duct 没有 Search Console 的更改操作，因此无法在 Search Console 中编辑任何内容。但它仍然可以为你推荐在那里进行的更改。"

#. meta description
#: integrations/google-search-console.html
msgid ""
"Duct reads Search Console query by page, up to 50,000 rows, and joins it to GA4, so it can say which searches bring trials and which only bring impressions."
msgstr ""
"Duct 读取 Search Console 的按页面查询数据（最多 50,000 行），并将其与 GA4 关联，因此它可以判断哪些搜索带来了试用，哪些只带来了展示。"

#: integrations/google-search-console.html
msgid ""
"Duct reads the queries and pages in Search Console, and which query lands on which page, then joins it to GA4. So it can say what organic search is worth, not just how much of it there is."
msgstr ""
"Duct 读取 Search Console 中的查询和页面数据，以及哪个查询对应哪个页面，然后将其与 GA4 关联。因此它可以说明自然搜索的价值，而不仅仅是其数量。"

#: integrations/google-search-console.html
msgid ""
"Final data zeroes the newest days, which reads like a cliff. Duct asks for all data, so the week ends where it really ends."
msgstr "最终数据将最新几天的数据归零，这看起来像一个断崖。Duct 请求所有数据，这样一周的结束才是真正的结束。"

#: integrations/google-search-console.html
msgid "GSC page performance"
msgstr "GSC 页面表现"

#: integrations/google-search-console.html
msgid "GSC query performance"
msgstr "GSC 查询表现"

#: integrations/google-search-console.html
msgid "GSC query × page"
msgstr "GSC 查询 × 页面"

#: integrations/google-search-console.html
msgid ""
"Google hides rare queries, so the page table shows several times the clicks of the query table. Duct uses pages for how much, and queries for which terms."
msgstr "Google 隐藏了罕见查询，因此页面表格显示的点击量是查询表格的数倍。Duct 使用页面来衡量数量，使用查询来衡量具体词条。"

#: integrations/google-search-console.html
msgid "How much of my property does it read?"
msgstr "它读取了我的多少资源？"

#: integrations/google-search-console.html
msgid "Impressions are up. Why are trials flat?"
msgstr "展示量上升了。为什么试用量持平？"

#: integrations/google-search-console.html
msgid ""
"Impressions up 23%, on invoicing queries at position 11. The tax pages still earn 61% of trials."
msgstr "展示量上升 23%，在排名第 11 位的开票查询上。税务页面仍带来 61% 的试用量。"

#. meta og:description
#: integrations/google-search-console.html
msgid ""
"Impressions up, trials flat? Duct reads Search Console query by page beside GA4 and finds the queries you rank for and don't convert."
msgstr "展示量上升，试用量持平？Duct 读取 Search Console 的查询与页面数据，并结合 GA4 找出你排名靠前但未转化的查询。"

#: integrations/google-search-console.html
msgid "In Duct, open the Toolbox and choose Google Search Console."
msgstr "在 Duct 中，打开工具箱并选择 Google Search Console。"

#: integrations/google-search-console.html
msgid "Is organic growth real, or bots?"
msgstr "自然增长是真实的，还是机器人？"

#: integrations/google-search-console.html
msgid "Most clicks come without a query."
msgstr "大多数点击没有查询词。"

#: integrations/google-search-console.html
msgid ""
"No. It asks for read access only and has no Search Console change operation. It reads queries, pages and positions and can tell you what to change on your site."
msgstr "不。它只请求读取权限，并且没有 Search Console 的更改操作。它读取查询、页面和排名，并能告诉你网站上需要更改什么。"

#: integrations/google-search-console.html
msgid "Pick the property this project reads."
msgstr "选择此项目读取的资源。"

#: integrations/google-search-console.html
msgid "Query by page is the only view of cannibalisation."
msgstr "查询与页面是唯一能看到关键词蚕食的视图。"

#: integrations/google-search-console.html
msgid "Read the Search Console notes Duct's agent works from <0/>"
msgstr "阅读 Duct 智能体的工作依据 Search Console 笔记 <0/>"

#: integrations/google-search-console.html
msgid ""
"Read-only: Duct asks Google for Search Console read access and has no Search Console change operation."
msgstr "只读：Duct 请求 Google Search Console 的只读权限，并且没有 Search Console 的更改操作。"

#. meta og:title
#. meta twitter:title
#: integrations/google-search-console.html
msgid "Search Console AI analyst: queries that convert"
msgstr "Search Console AI 分析师：转化查询"

#: integrations/google-search-console.html
msgid "Search Console AI analyst: queries that convert | Duct"
msgstr "Search Console AI 分析师：转化查询 | Duct"

#: integrations/google-search-console.html
msgid ""
"Search Console API (searchconsole-v1) · fields audited Sep 24, 2026 · <0>read the source</0>"
msgstr ""
"Search Console API (searchconsole-v1) · 字段审计日期 2026 年 9 月 24 日 · <0>阅读源代码</0>"

#: integrations/google-search-console.html
msgid ""
"Search Console counts clicks from Google; GA4 counts sessions from every search engine. A GA4 figure one to three and a half times the Search Console one is normal. Far outside that, Duct suspects bots or a tagging break before reporting either number."
msgstr ""
"Search Console 统计来自 Google 的点击量；GA4 统计来自所有搜索引擎的会话量。GA4 的数据是 Search Console 的 1 到 3.5 倍是正常的。如果超出这个范围，Duct 会怀疑是机器人或标签中断，然后才会报告任何数字。"

#: integrations/google-search-console.html
msgid ""
"Search Console sorts by clicks and returns 25,000 rows at a time. Read short, and the zero-click impressions, the list of what to write next, disappear. Duct reads two pages, up to 50,000 rows."
msgstr ""
"Search Console 按点击量排序，每次返回 25,000 行。如果读取不足，零点击展示量以及接下来要写的内容列表就会消失。Duct 读取两页，最多 50,000 行。"

#: integrations/google-search-console.html
msgid "Search Console, <0>answered</0>"
msgstr "Search Console，<0>已解答</0>"

#: integrations/google-search-console.html
msgid "Search Console, <0>down to the query that converts.</0>"
msgstr "Search Console，<0>深入到转化查询。</0>"

#. meta twitter:description
#: integrations/google-search-console.html
msgid "Search Console, read to the long tail and joined to GA4."
msgstr "Search Console，读取长尾数据并与 GA4 关联。"

#: integrations/google-search-console.html
msgid "Sign in with Google and allow read access."
msgstr "使用 Google 登录并允许读取权限。"

#: integrations/google-search-console.html
msgid "The last three days aren't final."
msgstr "最近三天的数据不是最终数据。"

#: integrations/google-search-console.html
msgid "The long tail is where the work is."
msgstr "长尾是工作的重点。"

#: integrations/google-search-console.html
msgid ""
"Two of your pages splitting one query shows up nowhere else. Duct reads query and page together."
msgstr "你的两个页面争夺同一个查询的情况在其他地方无法显示。Duct 同时读取查询和页面。"

#: integrations/google-search-console.html
msgid ""
"Up to 50,000 rows a window, two of Search Console's pages. Past that the rows are too small to change an answer."
