msgstr "账号和容器"

#: integrations/google-tag-manager.html
msgid ""
"Ask why an event stopped counting. Duct finds the tag version 14 changed, stages the fix in a workspace, and holds the publish for you with version 14 as the rollback."
msgstr "询问事件为何停止计数。Duct 发现是代码版本 14 发生了更改，在工作区中暂存修复，并为你保留发布，将版本 14 作为回滚版本。"

