msgid "In GrowthBook, open Settings, then API Keys, and create a read-only key."
msgstr "在 GrowthBook 中，打开设置，然后选择 API Keys，创建一个只读密钥。"

#: integrations/growthbook.html
msgid "Is this experiment ready to call?"
msgstr "这个实验准备好调用了吗？"

#: integrations/growthbook.html
msgid ""
"It flags a running experiment whose phase is older than 45 days and whose results don't reach the last week: the pattern of a test that looks alive and isn't."
msgstr "它会标记一个正在运行的实验，该实验的阶段已超过 45 天，且其结果未达到上周：这是一种看起来活跃但并非如此的测试模式。"

