#. img alt
#: integrations/meta-ads.html
msgid ""
"A Duct session: asked why Meta looks cheaper than Google, Duct reads Meta ad sets and insights on three attribution windows beside Google Ads, and recounts purchases on one-day click"
msgstr ""
"一次 Duct 会话：当被问及为何 Meta 看起来比 Google 便宜时，Duct 读取 Meta 广告组和 Google Ads 旁边的三个归因窗口的洞察，并重新计算一天内点击的购买次数"

#: integrations/meta-ads.html
msgid ""
"A token made from a person's login expires after about 60 days, and the connection stops without warning. A System User token does not expire, so the weekly brief keeps working."
msgstr "由个人登录生成的令牌在大约 60 天后过期，连接会无预警中断。系统用户令牌不会过期，因此每周简报会持续工作。"

#: integrations/meta-ads.html
msgid "Ad sets and ads"
msgstr "广告组和广告"

#: integrations/meta-ads.html
msgid ""
"Ask why Meta looks three times cheaper. Duct recounts its purchases the way Google counts, one action type and a one-day click, and puts the two side by side."
msgstr "询问为什么 Meta 看起来便宜三倍。Duct 会像 Google 一样重新计算其购买量，即一种操作类型和一天点击归因，并将两者并列比较。"

#: integrations/meta-ads.html
msgid "Attribution is a choice, not a fact."
msgstr "归因是一种选择，而非事实。"

#: integrations/meta-ads.html
msgid "Budgets come back in cents."
msgstr "预算以美分返回。"

#: integrations/meta-ads.html
msgid "Campaigns, every status"
msgstr "广告系列，所有状态"

#: integrations/meta-ads.html
msgid "Can Duct change my Meta campaigns?"
msgstr "Duct 可以更改我的 Meta 广告系列吗？"

#: integrations/meta-ads.html
msgid "Connect Meta Ads <0>in three steps</0>"
msgstr "连接 Meta Ads <0>三步完成</0>"

#: integrations/meta-ads.html
msgid ""
"Duct has no Meta Ads change operation, so it cannot edit anything in Meta Ads. It can still recommend a change for you to make there."
msgstr "Duct 没有 Meta Ads 更改操作，因此无法编辑 Meta Ads 中的任何内容。它仍然可以为你推荐在那里进行的更改。"

#. meta description
#: integrations/meta-ads.html
msgid ""
"Duct reads Meta Ads with a System User token, counts each purchase once on the attribution window you choose, and checks it against Stripe. Read-only."
msgstr "Duct 使用 System User 令牌读取 Meta Ads，在你选择的归因窗口内将每次购买只计算一次，并与 Stripe 进行核对。只读。"

#: integrations/meta-ads.html
msgid ""
"Generate a token for it with ads_read (and business_management, so Duct can list your accounts)."
msgstr "为其生成一个带有 ads_read 权限的令牌（以及 business_management 权限，以便 Duct 可以列出你的账户）。"

#: integrations/meta-ads.html
msgid "How much of Meta's credit comes from views, not clicks?"
msgstr "Meta 的多少归因来自展示，而非点击？"

#: integrations/meta-ads.html
msgid "In Duct, open the Toolbox, choose Meta Ads and paste the token."
msgstr "在 Duct 中，打开工具箱，选择 Meta Ads 并粘贴令牌。"

#: integrations/meta-ads.html
msgid ""
"In Meta Business Settings, open Users, then System users, and give one access to the ad account."
msgstr "在 Meta Business Settings 中，打开用户，然后是系统用户，并授予其中一个系统用户访问广告账户的权限。"

#: integrations/meta-ads.html
msgid "Is Meta really cheaper than Google, counted the same way?"
msgstr "以相同方式计算，Meta 真的比 Google 便宜吗？"

#. meta og:title
#. meta twitter:title
#: integrations/meta-ads.html
msgid "Meta Ads AI analyst: purchases counted once"
msgstr "Meta Ads AI 分析师：购买量只计算一次"

#: integrations/meta-ads.html
msgid "Meta Ads AI analyst: purchases counted once | Duct"
msgstr "Meta Ads AI 分析师：购买量只计算一次 | Duct"

#: integrations/meta-ads.html
msgid "Meta Ads, <0>answered</0>"
msgstr "Meta Ads，<0>已解答</0>"

