#. img alt
#: integrations/revenuecat.html
msgid ""
"A Duct session: asked what the app earns next to the web, Duct reads RevenueCat metrics and a hashed customer sample beside Stripe and adds app MRR to web MRR"
msgstr ""
"一次 Duct 会话：询问应用相对于网页的收入时，Duct 读取 RevenueCat 指标和 Stripe 旁边的哈希客户样本，并将应用 MRR 添加到网页 MRR"

#: integrations/revenuecat.html
msgid "An SDK key can't read the API."
msgstr "SDK 密钥无法读取 API。"

#: integrations/revenuecat.html
msgid "Apps, products, entitlements and offerings"
msgstr "应用、产品、权益和优惠"

#: integrations/revenuecat.html
msgid ""
"Ask what the app earns. Duct adds RevenueCat's app MRR to Stripe's web MRR and shows which platform pays."
msgstr "询问应用收入。Duct 将 RevenueCat 的应用 MRR 添加到 Stripe 的网页 MRR，并显示哪个平台支付。"

#: integrations/revenuecat.html
msgid "Can Duct change products, offerings or subscriptions?"
msgstr "Duct 可以更改产品、优惠或订阅吗？"

#: integrations/revenuecat.html
msgid "Connect RevenueCat <0>in three steps</0>"
msgstr "连接 RevenueCat <0>分三步</0>"

#: integrations/revenuecat.html
msgid "Customer IDs are hashed."
msgstr "客户 ID 已哈希。"

#: integrations/revenuecat.html
msgid "Customers, a sample of 500"
msgstr "客户，500 个样本"

#: integrations/revenuecat.html
msgid "Did the Apple Search Ads installs start trials?"
msgstr "Apple Search Ads 安装是否启动了试用？"

#: integrations/revenuecat.html
msgid "Do Android users pay like iOS users?"
msgstr "Android 用户是否像 iOS 用户一样付费？"

#: integrations/revenuecat.html
msgid ""
"Duct has no RevenueCat change operation, so it cannot edit anything in RevenueCat. It can still recommend a change for you to make there."
msgstr "Duct 没有 RevenueCat 变更操作，因此无法在 RevenueCat 中编辑任何内容。它仍然可以推荐你进行更改。"

#: integrations/revenuecat.html
msgid ""
"Duct keeps a SHA-256 of each app user ID: enough to join one pull to the next, useless for identifying a person."
msgstr "Duct 保留每个应用用户 ID 的 SHA-256：足以将一次拉取连接到下一次，但无法用于识别个人。"

#. meta description
#: integrations/revenuecat.html
msgid ""
"Duct reads RevenueCat's subscriptions, trials and MRR beside Stripe and your app ads, so web and app revenue read as one number. Read-only, customer IDs hashed."
msgstr ""
"Duct 读取 RevenueCat 的订阅、试用和 MRR，并结合 Stripe 和你的应用广告数据，使网页和应用收入显示为一个数字。只读，客户 ID 已哈希处理。"

#: integrations/revenuecat.html
msgid ""
"From a sample of 500 customers: when each was first and last seen, their country and platform, and their active entitlements, with the user ID hashed."
msgstr "来自 500 名客户的样本：每位客户首次和最后一次出现的时间、国家和平台，以及他们的活跃权益，用户 ID 已哈希处理。"

#: integrations/revenuecat.html
msgid ""
"Give it read access to project configuration, customer information and charts metrics."
msgstr "授予它读取项目配置、客户信息和图表指标的权限。"

#: integrations/revenuecat.html
msgid "How many trials are active right now?"
msgstr "当前有多少试用活跃？"

#: integrations/revenuecat.html
msgid "In Duct, open the Toolbox, choose RevenueCat and paste the key."
msgstr "在 Duct 中，打开工具箱，选择 RevenueCat 并粘贴密钥。"

#: integrations/revenuecat.html
msgid ""
"In RevenueCat, open Project settings, then API keys, and create a secret API key (V2)."
msgstr "在 RevenueCat 中，打开项目设置，然后选择 API 密钥，并创建秘密 API 密钥 (V2)。"

#: integrations/revenuecat.html
msgid ""
"Installs and in-app events are signals. RevenueCat sees refunds, billing retries and cancellations, so Duct checks app ad conversions against it, never the reverse."
msgstr "安装和应用内事件是信号。RevenueCat 会看到退款、账单重试和取消，因此 Duct 会对照它检查应用广告转化，从不反向操作。"

#: integrations/revenuecat.html
msgid ""
"Keys starting appl_ or goog_ are for the app. Reading needs a secret V2 key, and Duct tells you if you pasted the wrong kind."
msgstr "以 appl_ 或 goog_ 开头的密钥用于应用。读取需要秘密 V2 密钥，如果你粘贴了错误的类型，Duct 会告诉你。"

#: integrations/revenuecat.html
msgid "Metrics are rate-limited hard."
msgstr "指标受到严格的速率限制。"

#: integrations/revenuecat.html
msgid ""
"No. Duct has no RevenueCat change operation. It reads metrics, configuration and a customer sample."
msgstr "不。Duct 没有 RevenueCat 更改操作。它读取指标、配置和客户样本。"

#: integrations/revenuecat.html
msgid "Overview metrics"
msgstr "概览指标"

#: integrations/revenuecat.html
msgid "Read the RevenueCat notes Duct's agent works from <0/>"
msgstr "阅读 Duct 智能体的工作依据的 RevenueCat 笔记 <0/>"

#: integrations/revenuecat.html
msgid ""
"Read-only: a key with read scopes cannot change a product or a subscription, and Duct has no RevenueCat change operation."
msgstr "只读：具有读取范围的密钥无法更改产品或订阅，Duct 没有 RevenueCat 更改操作。"

