msgstr "RevenueCat 是应用收入的真相。"

#: integrations/revenuecat.html
msgid ""
"RevenueCat's metrics API allows 25 requests a minute. Duct paces its reads rather than finding the limit by failing."
msgstr "RevenueCat 的指标 API 每分钟允许 25 次请求。Duct 会控制读取速度，而不是通过失败来触及限制。"

