msgstr "秘密密钥 (V2)"

#: integrations/revenuecat.html
msgid ""
"Stripe sees the web. RevenueCat sees the App Store and Google Play. Duct reads both so MRR is one number, and checks app ad installs against the subscriptions they turned into."
msgstr ""
"Stripe 查看网页。RevenueCat 查看 App Store 和 Google Play。Duct 读取两者，使 MRR 是一个数字，并对照应用广告安装量检查它们转化成的订阅量。"

#. meta og:description
#: integrations/revenuecat.html
msgid ""
"Stripe sees the web. RevenueCat sees the App Store and Google Play. Duct reads both, so MRR is one number and app ads answer to it."
msgstr ""
"Stripe 查看网页。RevenueCat 查看 App Store 和 Google Play。Duct 读取两者，使 MRR 是一个数字，应用广告以此为准。"

#: integrations/revenuecat.html
msgid ""
"The app earns €6,900 MRR on top of Stripe's €18,400. Android pays at half the iOS rate."
msgstr "应用在 Stripe 的 €18,400 之外赚取 €6,900 MRR。Android 的支付率是 iOS 的一半。"

#: integrations/revenuecat.html
msgid ""
"The keys in your app are public SDK keys, and they cannot read RevenueCat's REST API. A secret V2 key with read scopes can."
msgstr "你应用中的密钥是公共 SDK 密钥，它们无法读取 RevenueCat 的 REST API。具有读取范围的秘密 V2 密钥可以。"

#. meta twitter:description
#: integrations/revenuecat.html
msgid ""
"Web MRR plus app MRR, read as one number. Then the app ads, checked against it."
msgstr "网页 MRR 加上应用 MRR，读取为一个数字。然后对照它检查应用广告。"

