#: privacy.html
msgid "<0>Advertising:</0> Meta Ads, Apple Search Ads, OpenAI Ads"
msgstr "<0>广告：</0> Meta Ads、Apple Search Ads、OpenAI Ads"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"<0>Approval is per change set, not blanket.</0> Approving one change does not authorise future ones."
msgstr "<0>批准是针对每个变更集，而非一揽子。</0> 批准一项变更不授权未来的变更。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"<0>Approved changes:</0> To apply the specific changes you approve, to the connected account you selected"
msgstr "<0>已批准的变更：</0> 将你批准的特定变更应用到你选择的已连接账户"

#: privacy.html
msgid "<0>Authentication:</0> To verify your identity and maintain your session"
msgstr "<0>身份验证：</0> 用于验证你的身份并保持你的会话"

#: privacy.html
msgid "<0>CRM:</0> HubSpot"
msgstr "<0>CRM：</0> HubSpot"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"<0>Changes are recorded and reversible where the underlying API allows it.</0> Every applied change is written to an audit log against your project."
msgstr "<0>变更会被记录，并且在底层 API 允许的情况下可逆。</0> 每项已应用的变更都会写入你的项目审计日志。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"<0>Crash reports and usage data are on by default in the app we distribute, and one switch in Preferences turns both off.</0> Once you touch it your answer is kept and no default applies again. A crash report contains the error and the stack trace that caused it; usage data is which screens and features you open — never your provider API keys, your data, or anything you generate. If you are signed in, both carry your account ID. If you build Duct yourself both are off by default instead, because then we are not the ones running it."
msgstr ""
"<0>在我们分发的应用中，崩溃报告和使用数据默认开启，偏好设置中的一个开关可以关闭两者。</0> 一旦你更改了设置，你的选择将被保留，默认设置将不再适用。崩溃报告包含导致错误的错误信息和堆栈跟踪；使用数据是你打开的屏幕和功能——绝不包含你的提供商 API 密钥、你的数据或你生成的任何内容。如果你已登录，两者都包含你的账户 ID。如果你自行构建 Duct，两者默认关闭，因为在这种情况下并非由我们运行。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"<0>Delete your account and all associated data:</0> email <1>hello@getduct.ai</1>. We action deletion requests within 30 days and confirm by email when complete."
msgstr ""
"<0>删除你的账户及所有相关数据：</0> 发送电子邮件至 <1>hello@getduct.ai</1>。我们会在 30 天内处理删除请求，并在完成后通过电子邮件确认。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"<0>Desktop app:</0> deleting the app's data directory removes the local database and its contents; provider keys are removed from your keychain when you delete them in the app."
msgstr "<0>桌面应用：</0> 删除应用的数据目录会移除本地数据库及其内容；当你从应用中删除提供商密钥时，它们会从你的钥匙串中移除。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"<0>Disconnect one source:</0> remove it from the Toolbox in Duct. Its stored credentials are deleted at that point."
msgstr "<0>断开一个来源：</0>将其从 Duct 的工具箱中移除。此时，其存储的凭据将被删除。"

#: privacy.html
msgid "<0>Experimentation:</0> GrowthBook"
msgstr "<0>实验：</0>GrowthBook"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"<0>Files you upload</0> (images, video, brand assets) are stored so they can be attached to drafts and published posts."
msgstr "<0>你上传的文件</0>（图片、视频、品牌资产）会被存储，以便可以附加到草稿和已发布的帖子中。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"<0>Generated media.</0> Images and video created in Duct are produced by third-party generative AI services, which receive the prompt and any reference image you supply."
msgstr "<0>生成的媒体。</0>在 Duct 中创建的图片和视频由第三方生成式 AI 服务生成，这些服务会接收你提供的提示和任何参考图片。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"<0>Google Analytics is not part of that choice.</0> Its cookies below are set when a page loads, wherever you are and whatever you choose."
msgstr "<0>Google Analytics 不属于该选择范围。</0>无论你身在何处、做出何种选择，其下方的 cookie 都会在页面加载时设置。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"<0>Google LLC is a US company and may process what it receives in the United States,</0> under the safeguards in its data processing terms. What Google's advertising services receive is also used as described in <1>Google's privacy policy</1>."
msgstr ""
"<0>Google LLC 是一家美国公司，可能会在美国处理其接收到的数据，</0>并遵循其数据处理条款中的保障措施。Google 广告服务接收到的数据也会按照<1>Google 隐私政策</1>中的描述使用。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"<0>In the desktop app,</0> keys are stored in your operating system's keychain. They are sent with a request so that the job you asked for can run, and we never store them; the option to save a key with us is switched off there."
msgstr ""
"<0>在桌面应用中，</0>密钥存储在你的操作系统的钥匙串中。它们随请求发送，以便你请求的任务可以运行，我们从不存储它们；在那里，与我们一起保存密钥的选项是关闭的。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"<0>In the web app,</0> a key you paste is held for that browser session and sent with each request. If you choose to save it so you do not have to paste it again, it is encrypted at rest, decrypted only to make a request on your behalf, never returned by our API, and never written to logs. You can delete it at any time."
msgstr ""
"<0>在网页应用中，</0>你粘贴的密钥会保留在该浏览器会话中，并随每个请求发送。如果你选择保存它，以便不必再次粘贴，它会在静态时加密，仅在代表你发出请求时解密，绝不会由我们的 API 返回，也绝不会写入日志。你可以随时删除它。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"<0>In the web app,</0> everything you type, and also all text on screen, images, embedded documents, charts and video. A replay of the app shows the layout, your clicks and where you went, never the data on the page. When PostHog counts a click in the app, it records which element was clicked, not the text on it."
msgstr ""
"<0>在网页应用中，</0>你输入的所有内容，以及屏幕上的所有文本、图片、嵌入文档、图表和视频。应用的重放会显示布局、你的点击和访问路径，但从不显示页面上的数据。当 PostHog 统计应用中的点击时，它会记录点击了哪个元素，而不是元素上的文本。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"<0>Nothing is written automatically.</0> Duct proposes a change set, shows you the exact before-and-after for every individual change, and applies nothing until you explicitly approve it in the app."
msgstr "<0>不会自动写入任何内容。</0>Duct 会提出一个变更集，向你展示每个单独变更的确切前后对比，并且在你明确在应用中批准之前，不会应用任何内容。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"<0>OAuth tokens and saved provider keys are encrypted at rest</0> using Fernet symmetric encryption, stored server-side per user, and never exposed to the browser"
msgstr "<0>OAuth 令牌和保存的提供商密钥在静态时加密</0>使用 Fernet 对称加密，按用户存储在服务器端，并且绝不暴露给浏览器"

#: privacy.html
msgid "<0>On our website,</0> everything you type into a field."
msgstr "<0>在我们的网站上，</0>你输入到字段中的所有内容。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"<0>OpenRouter is a router, not a model provider,</0> and it warrants a specific note. It forwards a request to whichever underlying provider the routing configuration selects, and those providers differ in whether they log or train on what they receive. Where you supply your own OpenRouter key, that routing configuration is yours: the retention and training behaviour of a request is governed by the data policy set on your OpenRouter account, and you should set it to match the commitments you need. We recommend enabling OpenRouter's zero-logging and no-training data policy before connecting a key. Duct does not use your data for training regardless of which route is taken."
msgstr ""
"<0>OpenRouter 是一个路由器，而不是模型提供商，</0>需要特别说明。它会将请求转发到路由配置选择的任何底层提供商，这些提供商在是否记录或训练其接收到的数据方面有所不同。当你提供自己的 OpenRouter 密钥时，该路由配置属于你：请求的保留和训练行为受你的 OpenRouter 账户上设置的数据策略管辖，你应该将其设置为符合你所需承诺的策略。我们建议在连接密钥之前启用 OpenRouter 的零日志和无训练数据策略。无论采用哪种路由，Duct 都不会使用你的数据进行训练。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"<0>PostHog, Inc. is a US company, and stores what it receives in its US region.</0> Sending it data from the EU relies on the EU Standard Contractual Clauses in PostHog's data processing agreement."
msgstr ""
"<0>PostHog, Inc. 是一家美国公司，并将其接收到的数据存储在美国区域。</0>从欧盟向其发送数据依赖于 PostHog 数据处理协议中的欧盟标准合同条款。"

#: privacy.html
msgid "<0>Product and behavioural analytics:</0> Mixpanel, Microsoft Clarity"
msgstr "<0>产品和行为分析：</0>Mixpanel, Microsoft Clarity"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"<0>Public research data.</0> Duct can retrieve publicly available content and metrics from social platforms to inform recommendations. This is public data, not data about you or your audience individually."
msgstr "<0>公开研究数据。</0>Duct 可以从社交平台检索公开可用的内容和指标，以提供建议。这是公开数据，而不是关于你或你的受众的个人数据。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"<0>Publishing.</0> When you schedule or publish a post, its content and media are transmitted to PostBridge and on to the social platform you selected, under that platform's own terms and privacy policy."
msgstr "<0>发布。</0>当你安排或发布帖子时，其内容和媒体会传输到 PostBridge，并进一步传输到你选择的社交平台，遵循该平台自己的条款和隐私政策。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"<0>Reporting works without write access.</0> If you prefer read-only, connect the read-only scopes and decline the rest; Duct's reports still function."
msgstr "<0>报告功能无需写入权限即可工作。</0>如果你偏好只读，请连接只读范围并拒绝其余权限；Duct 的报告仍然可以运行。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"<0>Reports and insights:</0> To fetch data from your connected properties and generate the briefs, alerts and audits you request"
msgstr "<0>报告和洞察：</0>从你连接的资产中获取数据，并生成你请求的简报、警报和审计"

#: privacy.html
msgid "<0>Revenue and billing:</0> Stripe, RevenueCat"
msgstr "<0>收入和账单：</0>Stripe, RevenueCat"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"<0>Revoke Duct's access at Google:</0> visit <1>myaccount.google.com/permissions</1> and remove Duct. This works whether or not you still have a Duct account."
msgstr ""
"<0>撤销 Duct 在 Google 的访问权限：</0>访问 <1>myaccount.google.com/permissions</1> 并移除 Duct。无论你是否仍有 Duct 账户，这都有效。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"<0>Sign-in and connector authorisation open your system browser</0> rather than an embedded window, so you keep your browser's own protections, and no credential is ever carried in the link that returns you to the app."
msgstr "<0>登录和连接器授权会打开你的系统浏览器</0>而不是嵌入式窗口，这样你可以保留浏览器自身的保护，并且返回应用的链接中绝不会携带任何凭据。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"<0>Social publishing and analytics:</0> PostBridge, which in turn connects the social accounts you authorise (TikTok, Instagram, YouTube, LinkedIn, X, Pinterest, Facebook, Google Business Profile)"
msgstr ""
"<0>社交发布和分析：</0>PostBridge，它会连接你授权的社交账户（TikTok、Instagram、YouTube、LinkedIn、X、Pinterest、Facebook、Google Business Profile）"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"<0>Support:</0> To diagnose a problem you report to us, using the minimum data needed"
msgstr "<0>支持：</0>诊断你向我们报告的问题，使用所需的最少数据"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"<0>The app we distribute talks to our servers.</0> It does not carry its own copy of Duct's backend. Your projects, briefs, agent memories, activity log, uploads and connector authorisations are stored by us, exactly as they are when you use Duct in a browser — which is also what lets you sign in on a second computer and find your work there. Sections 12 to 14 cover how we store, share and delete it."
msgstr ""
"<0>我们分发的应用与我们的服务器通信。</0>它不包含 Duct 后端自身的副本。你的项目、简报、智能体记忆、活动日志、上传内容和连接器授权都由我们存储，与你在浏览器中使用 Duct 时完全相同——这也是为什么你可以在第二台电脑上登录并找到你的工作。第 12 至 14 节涵盖我们如何存储、共享和删除它。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"<0>The desktop app never asks you about cookies.</0> Its usage events and crash reports go to PostHog, which in the desktop app holds everything in memory and writes nothing to your machine, so PostHog's cookie does not exist there. A consent bar in front of an application you just opened is not a question worth interrupting anyone for. The app's window does load our web app, so Google Analytics runs there too, sets the Google cookies listed in section 11, and is not affected by the switch below."
msgstr ""
"<0>桌面应用从不询问你的 Cookie。</0> 它的使用事件和崩溃报告会发送到 PostHog，在桌面应用中，PostHog 将所有内容保存在内存中，不会写入你的机器，因此 PostHog 的 Cookie 不存在。在你刚打开的应用前出现同意栏，不值得为此打断任何人。应用的窗口确实会加载我们的网页应用，所以 Google Analytics 也会在那里运行，设置第 11 节中列出的 Google Cookie，并且不受下方开关的影响。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"<0>The desktop app never records a replay of your session.</0> Session replay (section 11) exists only on our website and in the web app in a browser."
msgstr "<0>桌面应用从不记录你的会话回放。</0> 会话回放（第 11 节）仅存在于我们的网站和浏览器中的网页应用中。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"<0>The provider's data settings are yours to configure.</0> Whether a provider retains or trains on what it receives is governed by the policy on your account with that provider, not by us — see the note on routing in section 12."
msgstr ""
"<0>提供商的数据设置由你配置。</0> 提供商是否保留或训练其接收的数据，由你与该提供商账户的政策决定，而非我们——请参阅第 12 节中关于路由的说明。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"<0>Update checks</0> contact our release host to ask whether a newer version exists. This request reveals your IP address and the version you are running."
msgstr "<0>更新检查</0> 会联系我们的发布主机，询问是否存在新版本。此请求会透露你的 IP 地址和你正在运行的版本。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"<0>You can run the whole thing yourself instead.</0> The source is public, and it can be built with the backend inside the app or hosted on your own server. Then we hold nothing and this policy has nothing to describe — see section 16."
msgstr ""
"<0>你可以选择自行运行整个系统。</0> 源代码是公开的，可以在应用内部构建后端，或托管在你自己的服务器上。这样我们不保留任何数据，此政策也无需描述任何内容——请参阅第 16 节。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"<0>Your AI provider keys stay on your machine.</0> They live in your operating system's keychain, and are sent with a request only when a job needs to run. We never store them, and the option to save a key with us that the browser version offers is deliberately switched off in the desktop app."
msgstr ""
"<0>你的 AI 提供商密钥保留在你的机器上。</0> 它们存储在你的操作系统密钥链中，仅在任务需要运行时才随请求发送。我们从不存储它们，浏览器版本提供的保存密钥选项在桌面应用中已特意关闭。"

#: privacy.html
msgid "A stable Google account identifier"
msgstr "稳定的 Google 账户标识符"

#: privacy.html
msgid "AI model calls"
msgstr "AI 模型调用"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"AI models that generate report narratives, recommendations and content drafts"
msgstr "生成报告叙述、建议和内容草稿的 AI 模型"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"Access to a project's data requires both authentication and verified membership of that project; a non-member cannot read another project's data"
msgstr "访问项目数据需要身份验证和该项目的验证成员身份；非成员无法读取其他项目的数据"

#: privacy.html
msgid "Activity and agent memory"
msgstr "活动和智能体记忆"

#: privacy.html
msgid "All data in transit is encrypted via HTTPS/TLS"
msgstr "所有传输中的数据均通过 HTTPS/TLS 加密"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"Alleviate Lab (\"we\", \"us\", \"our\") operates Duct (<0>getduct.ai</0>), a cross-tool intelligence platform that connects your advertising, analytics, product and search tools, synthesises what changed across them, and — only when you approve a specific change — applies that change back to the connected tool. This Privacy Policy explains what we collect, why, who we share it with, how long we keep it, and how to delete it."
msgstr ""
"Alleviate Lab（“我们”）运营 Duct（<0>getduct.ai</0>），这是一个跨工具智能平台，它连接你的广告、分析、产品和搜索工具，综合分析它们之间的变化，并且——仅在你批准特定变更时——将该变更应用回已连接的工具。本隐私政策解释了我们收集什么、为什么收集、与谁共享、保留多久以及如何删除。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"Allow humans to read Google user data, except where you have given explicit consent for a specific issue, where it is necessary for security purposes or to comply with applicable law, or where the data has been aggregated and anonymised"
msgstr "允许人类读取 Google 用户数据，除非你已就特定问题明确同意，或出于安全目的或遵守适用法律的需要，或数据已聚合和匿名化。"

#: privacy.html
msgid "Anthropic, OpenAI, Google, OpenRouter"
msgstr "Anthropic、OpenAI、Google、OpenRouter"

#: privacy.html
msgid "Apify"
msgstr "Apify"

#: privacy.html
msgid "Application hosting and the primary database"
msgstr "应用托管和主数据库"

#: privacy.html
msgid "Audit tool submissions"
msgstr "审计工具提交"

#: privacy.html
msgid "Authentication tokens (browser)"
msgstr "身份验证令牌（浏览器）"

#: privacy.html
msgid "Backups"
msgstr "备份"

#: privacy.html
msgid "CDN, web application delivery, bot protection (Turnstile), email delivery"
msgstr "CDN、网页应用交付、机器人防护（Turnstile）、电子邮件发送"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"Caches the country your request arrived from, so we ask the right question without repeating the lookup. Strictly necessary"
msgstr "缓存你的请求来源国家，以便我们无需重复查找即可提出正确问题。严格必要"

#: privacy.html
msgid "Connected data sources"
msgstr "已连接的数据源"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"Connects a visit to an ad click, for measuring Google Ads. Not covered by the choice above"
msgstr "将访问与广告点击关联，用于衡量 Google Ads 效果。不受上述选择限制"

#: privacy.html
msgid "Cookie"
msgstr "Cookie"

#: privacy.html
msgid "Cookies and similar technologies"
msgstr "Cookie 和类似技术"

#: privacy.html
msgid "Data"
msgstr "数据"

#: privacy.html
msgid "Data controller: Alleviate Lab"
msgstr "数据控制者：Alleviate Lab"

#: privacy.html
msgid "Data fetched from connected sources"
msgstr "从已连接来源获取的数据"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"Data may be processed outside the EEA by the providers listed in section 12, under transfer mechanisms including the EU Standard Contractual Clauses."
msgstr "数据可能由第 12 节中列出的提供商在 EEA 境外处理，传输机制包括欧盟标准合同条款。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"Declining means PostHog is not loaded at all, rather than loaded in a restricted mode. If you decline after previously accepting, we stop PostHog, delete its cookie and its copy of it in your browser's storage, and reload the page. Google Analytics keeps running either way."
msgstr ""
"拒绝意味着 PostHog 完全不加载，而非以受限模式加载。如果你在之前接受后选择拒绝，我们将停止 PostHog，删除其 Cookie 及其在浏览器存储中的副本，并重新加载页面。Google Analytics 无论如何都会继续运行。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"Deleted data may persist in encrypted backups for up to 30 days after deletion"
msgstr "已删除数据在删除后最多可在加密备份中保留 30 天"

#: privacy.html
msgid "Deleting your data"
msgstr "删除你的数据"

#: privacy.html
msgid "Diagnostics"
msgstr "诊断"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"Distinguishes one visitor from another, and carries the same visit across <0>getduct.ai</0> and <1>app.getduct.ai</1> so it counts as one person, not two. PostHog may keep the same value in your browser's local storage"
msgstr ""
"区分不同访客，并在 <0>getduct.ai</0> 和 <1>app.getduct.ai</1> 之间保持相同的访问，因此计为一个人，而非两个人。PostHog 可能会在你的浏览器本地存储中保留相同的值"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"Distinguishes one visitor from another. Set on <0>getduct.ai</0> and all its subdomains. Not covered by the choice above"
msgstr "区分不同访客。设置在 <0>getduct.ai</0> 及其所有子域名上。不受上述选择限制"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"Do not upload material you lack the rights to use, or files containing other people's personal data beyond what your post requires."
msgstr "请勿上传你无权使用的材料，或包含他人个人数据超出你的帖子所需的文件。"

#: privacy.html
msgid "Duct (session storage)"
msgstr "Duct（会话存储）"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"Duct accesses Google user data only through official Google APIs, and only for the Google accounts and properties you explicitly connect. Nothing is accessed until you complete Google's consent screen, and every scope below is requested for the purpose stated beside it."
msgstr ""
"Duct 仅通过官方 Google API 访问 Google 用户数据，并且仅限于你明确连接的 Google 账户和属性。在你完成 Google 的同意界面之前，不会访问任何内容，下方每个范围都用于其旁所述目的。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"Duct is currently in beta, and features and data handling practices may evolve. We will update this policy as needed, revise the date at the top, and notify users of material changes by email at the address on their account before the change takes effect."
msgstr "Duct 目前处于测试阶段，功能和数据处理实践可能会演变。我们将根据需要更新此政策，修订顶部的日期，并在变更生效前通过电子邮件通知用户账户上的重大变更。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"Duct is not intended for use by individuals under 18 years of age. We do not knowingly collect information from children."
msgstr "Duct 不适用于未满 18 岁的个人。我们不会有意收集儿童信息。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"Duct projects can be shared. If you invite someone, we send an invitation to the email address you provide. Members of a project can see that project's connected sources, reports, insights and activity history, along with the name, email and profile picture of other members. Anyone with the right role can also see and approve changes proposed against connected accounts. Invite only people you intend to give that access."
msgstr ""
"Duct 项目可以共享。如果你邀请某人，我们会向你提供的电子邮件地址发送邀请。项目成员可以看到该项目连接的来源、报告、洞察和活动历史记录，以及其他成员的姓名、电子邮件和头像。任何具有适当角色的人还可以查看和批准针对已连接账户提出的变更集。只邀请你打算授予访问权限的人。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"Duct records an activity log of significant actions in a project, and stores durable notes its agents derive from your data (for example, a recurring seasonal pattern) so reports improve over time. Both are scoped to your project, visible to you, and deleted with it."
msgstr ""
"Duct 记录项目中重要操作的活动日志，并存储其智能体从你的数据中提取的持久性笔记（例如，重复的季节性模式），以便报告随时间推移而改进。两者都限定在你的项目范围内，对你可见，并随项目删除而删除。"

#. meta description
#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"Duct's privacy policy: the Google user data we access and why, how we handle data from every connected tool, who we share it with, and how to delete it."
msgstr "Duct 的隐私政策：我们访问的 Google 用户数据及其原因，我们如何处理来自每个连接工具的数据，我们与谁共享数据，以及如何删除数据。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"Duct's source code is published under the MIT licence. This policy covers <0>the hosted service we operate</0> at getduct.ai and app.getduct.ai, and the official desktop app we distribute."
msgstr ""
"Duct 的源代码在 MIT 许可下发布。本政策涵盖我们在 getduct.ai 和 app.getduct.ai <0>运营的托管服务</0>，以及我们分发的官方桌面应用。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"Duct's use and transfer of information received from Google APIs to any other app will adhere to the <0>Google API Services User Data Policy</0>, including the Limited Use requirements."
msgstr ""
"Duct 使用和传输从 Google API 接收的信息到任何其他应用时，将遵守 <0>Google API 服务用户数据政策</0>，包括有限使用要求。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"Each connector below is optional and connected separately. You may connect none, some, or all of them, and disconnect any of them at any time."
msgstr "下面的每个连接器都是可选的，并单独连接。你可以选择不连接、连接部分或全部连接器，并随时断开任何连接。"

#: privacy.html terms.html
msgid "Email: <0>hello@getduct.ai</0>"
msgstr "电子邮件：<0>hello@getduct.ai</0>"

#: privacy.html
msgid "End of session"
msgstr "会话结束"

#: privacy.html
msgid "Expires"
msgstr "过期时间"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"For each call Duct makes to an AI model we record metadata only: the model, the number of tokens, how long it took, what it cost, and any error. Never the prompt or the response text."
msgstr "对于 Duct 对 AI 模型进行的每次调用，我们只记录元数据：模型、token 数量、耗时、成本以及任何错误。绝不记录提示或响应文本。"

#: privacy.html
msgid "For privacy questions, data access or deletion requests:"
msgstr "有关隐私问题、数据访问或删除请求："

#: privacy.html
msgid "Generated reports, content drafts, uploads and audit logs"
msgstr "生成的报告、内容草稿、上传和审计日志"

#: privacy.html
msgid "Generative media providers"
msgstr "生成式媒体提供商"

#: privacy.html
msgid "Google (Analytics and Tag Manager)"
msgstr "Google（Analytics 和 Tag Manager）"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"Google Ads campaigns, ad groups, search terms, and performance metrics (clicks, impressions, cost, conversions, ROAS), plus device and geographic segmentation"
msgstr "Google Ads 广告系列、广告组、搜索词和效果指标（点击、展示、费用、转化、ROAS），以及设备和地理细分"

#: privacy.html
msgid "Google Analytics"
msgstr "Google Analytics"

#: privacy.html
msgid "Google Analytics 4 admin settings"
msgstr "Google Analytics 4 管理设置"

#: privacy.html
msgid "Google Analytics 4 reporting data and property configuration"
msgstr "Google Analytics 4 报告数据和媒体资源配置"

#: privacy.html
msgid "Google Search Console queries, pages, impressions, clicks and positions"
msgstr "Google Search Console 查询、页面、展示、点击和排名"

#: privacy.html
msgid "Google Tag Manager accounts, containers, tags and triggers"
msgstr "Google Tag Manager 账户、容器、代码和触发器"

#: privacy.html
msgid "Google Tag Manager container contents"
msgstr "Google Tag Manager 容器内容"

#: privacy.html
msgid "Google Tag Manager container versions"
msgstr "Google Tag Manager 容器版本"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"Google is one of several sources Duct can connect. Each is optional, connected individually by you, and accessed through the provider's official API using credentials you authorise. Duct reads the metrics needed to build your reports, and writes only changes you have explicitly approved."
msgstr ""
"Google 是 Duct 可以连接的多个来源之一。每个来源都是可选的，由你单独连接，并通过你授权的凭据访问提供商的官方 API。Duct 读取构建报告所需的指标，并且只写入你明确批准的变更。"

#: privacy.html
msgid "If you use Duct's content features:"
msgstr "如果你使用 Duct 的内容功能："

#: privacy.html
msgid "Image and video generation in Content Studio"
msgstr "Content Studio 中的图像和视频生成"

#: privacy.html
msgid "In transit"
msgstr "传输中"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"It does not cover an instance of the software that someone else runs. If you use a Duct deployment operated by a third party, or one you run yourself, the operator of that deployment is the data controller and this policy does not apply to it. Publishing the code does not give us access to any data held in a deployment we do not operate."
msgstr ""
"它不涵盖他人运行的软件实例。如果你使用由第三方运营的 Duct 部署，或你自己运行的部署，则该部署的运营者是数据控制者，本政策不适用于它。发布代码并不意味着我们可以访问我们不运营的部署中持有的任何数据。"

#: privacy.html
msgid "Keeps track of the current visit. Not covered by the choice above"
msgstr "跟踪当前访问。不属于上述选择范围"

#: privacy.html
msgid "Last updated: November 5, 2026"
msgstr "最后更新：2026 年 11 月 5 日"

#. meta og:description
#. meta twitter:description
#: privacy.html
msgid "Learn how Duct collects, uses, and protects your data."
msgstr "了解 Duct 如何收集、使用和保护你的数据。"

#: privacy.html
msgid "Locally stored data"
msgstr "本地存储的数据"

#: privacy.html terms.html
msgid "Location: Spain"
msgstr "地点：西班牙"

#: privacy.html
msgid "No"
msgstr "否"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"No — full page addresses, which can contain internal IDs, visit and device data, IP address and cookie identifiers, as described in section 11; never your connected tools' data or your prompts"
msgstr "否——完整的页面地址，其中可能包含内部 ID、访问和设备数据、IP 地址和 cookie 标识符，如第 11 节所述；绝不包含你连接工具的数据或你的提示"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"No — usage events, session replays masked as described in section 11, error reports, page timing and AI call metadata; never your connected tools' data or your prompts. An error report may incidentally contain an identifier, as described in section 11"
msgstr ""
"否——使用事件、如第 11 节所述进行屏蔽的会话回放、错误报告、页面计时和 AI 调用元数据；绝不包含你连接工具的数据或你的提示。错误报告可能偶然包含一个标识符，如第 11 节所述"

#: privacy.html
msgid "OAuth refresh tokens and saved provider keys"
msgstr "OAuth 刷新令牌和保存的提供商密钥"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"Our public SEO audit tool collects the email address and website URL you submit, retrieves pages from that website to analyse them, and emails you the resulting report. We store the submission and report so we can resend it and so we can contact you about Duct. Only submit a website you own or are authorised to audit. Ask us at <0>hello@getduct.ai</0> to delete a submission."
msgstr ""
"我们的公共 SEO 审计工具会收集你提交的电子邮件地址和网站 URL，从该网站检索页面进行分析，并通过电子邮件向你发送结果报告。我们存储提交内容和报告，以便我们可以重新发送并就 Duct 与你联系。只提交你拥有或被授权审计的网站。请通过 <0>hello@getduct.ai</0> 联系我们删除提交内容。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"Our servers report their own errors to PostHog the same way, along with a few log lines recording when a server starts and stops. We configure error reporting to avoid capturing Google user data, but a report may incidentally contain an identifier such as a property ID."
msgstr ""
"我们的服务器以同样的方式向 PostHog 报告其自身错误，并附带几行记录服务器启动和停止时间的日志。我们配置错误报告以避免捕获 Google 用户数据，但报告可能偶然包含一个标识符，例如媒体资源 ID。"

#: privacy.html
msgid "PostBridge"
msgstr "PostBridge"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"PostHog also records session replays: a reconstruction of the page and where you clicked, so we can watch where a visit went wrong. What a replay hides is hidden in your browser, before anything leaves it:"
msgstr ""
"PostHog 还会记录会话回放：对页面和你点击位置的重构，以便我们查看访问出了什么问题。回放隐藏的内容在你的浏览器中，在任何数据离开浏览器之前就已经隐藏了："

#. meta og:title
#. meta twitter:title
#: privacy.html
msgid "Privacy Policy — Duct"
msgstr "隐私政策——Duct"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"Product and web analytics, session replay, error and crash reporting, page-speed measurement, AI call metadata"
msgstr "产品和网络分析、会话回放、错误和崩溃报告、页面速度测量、AI 调用元数据"

#: privacy.html
msgid "Prompts and reference media only"
msgstr "仅提示词和参考媒体"

#: privacy.html
msgid "Provider"
msgstr "提供商"

#: privacy.html
msgid "Publishing to, and reading analytics from, your social accounts"
msgstr "发布到你的社交账户，并从其读取分析数据"

#: privacy.html
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "目的"

#: privacy.html
msgid "Receives connected-source data?"
msgstr "接收已连接源数据？"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"Remembers your choice, so you are not asked on every page. Set on <0>getduct.ai</0> and all its subdomains, so answering once in your browser also answers for the app. The desktop app never sets it, because it never asks (section 7). Strictly necessary — it exists whether you accept or decline"
msgstr ""
"记住你的选择，这样你就不会在每个页面都被询问。设置在 <0>getduct.ai</0> 及其所有子域名上，因此在浏览器中回答一次也适用于应用。桌面应用从不设置它，因为它从不询问（第 7 节）。严格必要——无论你接受还是拒绝，它都存在"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"Replays never include your browser's console logs. We do not record keystrokes or form contents."
msgstr "回放从不包含你的浏览器控制台日志。我们不记录按键或表单内容。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"Retained as part of the reports, insights, agent memory and working artifacts it produced, for as long as your account is active"
msgstr "作为其生成的报告、洞察、智能体记忆和工作成果文档的一部分保留，只要你的账户处于活跃状态"

#: privacy.html
msgid "Retention"
msgstr "保留期限"

#: privacy.html
msgid "Retrieving publicly available social content for research"
msgstr "检索公开可用的社交内容用于研究"

#: privacy.html
msgid "Scope"
msgstr "范围"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"Sell, rent, or transfer Google user data to data brokers, information resellers, or any third party for their own purposes"
msgstr "出售、出租或转让 Google 用户数据给数据经纪人、信息转售商或任何第三方用于其自身目的"

#: privacy.html
msgid "Session replays (PostHog)"
msgstr "会话回放 (PostHog)"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"Session replays and click analytics in the web app never record Google user data: all text on screen is masked in your browser before anything is sent (section 11)."
msgstr "网络应用中的会话回放和点击分析从不记录 Google 用户数据：屏幕上的所有文本在发送之前都会在你的浏览器中被遮盖（第 11 节）。"

#: privacy.html
msgid "Set by"
msgstr "设置者"

#: privacy.html
msgid "Sign-in"
msgstr "登录"

#: privacy.html
msgid "Social account data and post content only"
msgstr "仅社交账户数据和帖子内容"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"Some of the scopes above allow writes. We want to be precise about this, because it is the part of Duct that touches your live accounts:"
msgstr "上述某些范围允许写入。我们希望对此进行精确说明，因为这是 Duct 触及你实时账户的部分："

#: privacy.html
msgid "Specifically, we do <0>not</0>:"
msgstr "具体来说，我们<0>不</0>会："

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"The authentication token described under <0>Locally stored data</0> below is also strictly necessary: without it you cannot stay signed in."
msgstr "下方 <0>本地存储数据</0> 中描述的身份验证令牌也是严格必要的：没有它你就无法保持登录状态。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"The choice we ask for covers PostHog's analytics cookie. If you are in the EEA, the UK or Switzerland we ask before PostHog sets anything. Elsewhere it is on by default and you can turn it off at any time: the <0>Cookie settings</0> link in our footer, and in the account menu inside the app, reopens the choice on every page."
msgstr ""
"我们请求的选择涵盖 PostHog 的分析 Cookie。如果你在 EEA、英国或瑞士，我们会在 PostHog 设置任何内容之前征求你的同意。在其他地区，它默认开启，你可以随时关闭：我们页脚中的 <0>Cookie 设置</0> 链接，以及应用内的账户菜单，会在每个页面重新打开选择。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"The commitments in this policy — no sale of your data, no advertising use, no model training, deletion on request — apply to data from these sources exactly as they apply to Google user data."
msgstr "本政策中的承诺——不销售你的数据、不用于广告、不用于模型训练、按请求删除——适用于来自这些来源的数据，与适用于 Google 用户数据的方式完全相同。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"The desktop app is a native window around the same Duct you would use in a browser. It is worth being precise about what that means, because \"desktop app\" sounds like \"everything stays here\" and that is not what we ship:"
msgstr ""
"桌面应用是一个原生窗口，围绕着你在浏览器中使用的同一个 Duct。有必要精确说明这意味着什么，因为“桌面应用”听起来像是“所有东西都留在这里”，但这并非我们所交付的："

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"To apply approved configuration changes, such as marking an event as a key event"
msgstr "应用已批准的配置变更，例如将事件标记为关键事件"

#: privacy.html
msgid "To audit your measurement setup and detect broken or missing tracking"
msgstr "审计你的衡量设置并检测损坏或缺失的跟踪"

#: privacy.html
msgid "To display who is signed in and who took an action in a shared project"
msgstr "显示谁已登录以及谁在共享项目中执行了操作"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"To identify your account, send report notifications, and match project invitations"
msgstr "识别你的账户、发送报告通知并匹配项目邀请"

#: privacy.html
msgid "To prepare approved tracking fixes as a container change"
msgstr "准备已批准的跟踪修复作为容器变更"

#: privacy.html
msgid "To publish a container version after you approve it"
msgstr "在你批准后发布容器版本"

#: privacy.html
msgid "To recognise your account across sessions"
msgstr "跨会话识别你的账户"

#: privacy.html
msgid "To report on organic search performance and surface ranking changes"
msgstr "报告自然搜索表现并显示排名变化"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"To report on paid performance and, where you approve it, to add negative keywords or pause a campaign"
msgstr "报告付费表现，以及在你批准的情况下，添加否定关键词或暂停广告系列"

#: privacy.html
msgid "To report on traffic, conversion and retention alongside your other tools"
msgstr "报告流量、转化和留存，与你的其他工具一起"

#: privacy.html
msgid "Until you ask us to delete them"
msgstr "直到你要求我们删除它们"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"Until you disconnect the source, delete the key, delete your account, or revoke access at the provider — whichever is first"
msgstr "直到你断开源、删除密钥、删除你的账户或在提供商处撤销访问权限——以先发生者为准"

#: privacy.html
