msgstr "我们的 PostHog 方案最长保留 7 年"

#: privacy.html
msgid "Usage data"
msgstr "使用数据"

#: privacy.html
msgid "Usage events, error reports and AI call metadata (PostHog)"
msgstr "使用事件、错误报告和 AI 调用元数据 (PostHog)"

#: privacy.html
msgid "Use Google user data to build or enrich independent databases or profiles"
msgstr "使用 Google 用户数据来构建或丰富独立的数据库或用户画像"

#: privacy.html
msgid "Use Google user data to determine credit-worthiness or for lending purposes"
msgstr "使用 Google 用户数据来评估信用度或用于贷款目的"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"Use Google user data to develop, improve, or train generalised or non-personalised AI or machine learning models"
msgstr "使用 Google 用户数据开发、改进或训练通用或非个性化 AI 或机器学习模型"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"Use or transfer Google user data for serving advertising of any kind, including targeted, personalised, retargeted or interest-based advertising"
msgstr "使用或传输 Google 用户数据用于投放任何类型的广告，包括定向、个性化、重定向或基于兴趣的广告"

#: privacy.html
msgid "Visit data in Google Analytics"
msgstr "Google Analytics 中的访问数据"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"We also use Google Analytics, loaded through Google Tag Manager, to count visits and see where they come from. It runs on our website, in the web app and in the desktop app's window. <0>It does not follow the cookie choice described below:</0> it loads on every page, before you answer and after you decline. Google receives the full address of the page, where you came from, your browser and device, your IP address, which it uses to estimate your location, and an identifier from the cookies listed below. These tags also send visit data to Google's advertising services, including the one that builds ad audiences. We are not running Google Ads at the moment. If you do not want this, Google offers a <1>browser add-on that opts you out of Google Analytics</1>."
msgstr ""
"我们还使用通过 Google Tag Manager 加载的 Google Analytics 来统计访问量并查看其来源。它在我们的网站、网页应用和桌面应用的窗口中运行。<0>它不遵循下述 Cookie 选择：</0>它会在每个页面加载，在您回答之前和拒绝之后。Google 会收到页面的完整地址、您的来源、您的浏览器和设备、您的 IP 地址（用于估算您的位置）以及来自下方列出的 Cookie 的标识符。这些标签还会将访问数据发送到 Google 的广告服务，包括用于构建广告受众的服务。我们目前没有运行 Google Ads。如果您不希望这样，Google 提供了一个<1>浏览器插件，可让您选择退出 Google Analytics</1>。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"We are based in Spain and process personal data under the EU GDPR. You have the right to access, correct, export, restrict the processing of, or delete your personal data, and to object to processing. Our legal basis is the performance of our contract with you for operating the product; legitimate interest for security and diagnostics, including the error reports and server-side events in section 11; and your consent for analytics cookies and session replays where we ask for it. Exercise any of these rights at <0>hello@getduct.ai</0>; you also have the right to lodge a complaint with your local supervisory authority (in Spain, the AEPD)."
msgstr ""
"我们位于西班牙，并根据欧盟 GDPR 处理个人数据。您有权访问、更正、导出、限制处理或删除您的个人数据，并有权反对处理。我们的法律依据是履行我们与您签订的产品运营合同；出于安全和诊断的合法利益，包括第 11 节中的错误报告和服务器端事件；以及在征得您同意的情况下使用分析 Cookie 和会话回放。请通过 <0>hello@getduct.ai</0> 行使这些权利；您也有权向您当地的监管机构（在西班牙是 AEPD）提出投诉。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"We collect product analytics — pages visited, features used, what you click, how fast pages load — to see which pages earn a signup and where Duct gets in your way. On our website and in the web app in a browser this runs through PostHog, which follows the cookie choice described below."
msgstr ""
"我们收集产品分析数据——访问的页面、使用的功能、你的点击、页面加载速度——以了解哪些页面促成注册以及 Duct 在何处阻碍了你。在我们的网站和浏览器中的网络应用中，这通过 PostHog 运行，并遵循下方描述的 Cookie 选择。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"We do not sell your data. We share it only with the service providers below, only as needed to operate Duct, and, apart from what Google's advertising services receive, only under terms that restrict them to that purpose:"
msgstr ""
"我们不出售你的数据。我们仅在运营 Duct 所需时，与下方服务提供商共享数据，并且，除了 Google 的广告服务接收的数据外，仅在限制其用于该目的的条款下共享。"

#: privacy.html
msgid "We follow the principle of least privilege for internal data access"
msgstr "我们遵循内部数据访问的最小权限原则。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"We may also disclose data where required by law, and to a successor entity in the event of a merger or acquisition, in which case this policy continues to apply until you are notified otherwise."
msgstr "我们也可能在法律要求时披露数据，并在合并或收购的情况下向继承实体披露数据，届时本政策将继续适用，直到你收到另行通知。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"We store an authentication token in your browser's local storage to keep you signed in. It contains your name, email and profile picture, and expires after 7 days."
msgstr "我们在你的浏览器本地存储中存储一个身份验证令牌，以保持你登录。它包含你的姓名、电子邮件和个人资料图片，并于 7 天后过期。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"We use Google user data only to provide and improve these user-facing features. We do not use it for any other purpose."
msgstr "我们仅使用 Google 用户数据来提供和改进这些面向用户的功能。我们不将其用于任何其他目的。"

#: privacy.html
msgid "Website and app analytics, and advertising measurement"
msgstr "网站和应用分析，以及广告衡量"

#: privacy.html terms.html
msgid "Website: <0>getduct.ai</0>"
msgstr "网站：<0>getduct.ai</0>"

#: privacy.html
msgid "What it accesses"
msgstr "访问内容"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"When something breaks in the web app, it sends PostHog an error report: the stack trace, your browser, the page's path without its query string, and, if you are signed in, your account ID. The web app also sends how long each page took to load and respond (web vitals), which is timing and nothing else. <0>Error reports and page timing in the web app are sent whether or not you accept analytics cookies,</0> because they store nothing on your device: they are held in memory for that page and gone when you leave it. On our website, both are part of analytics and follow your cookie choice."
msgstr ""
"当 web 应用出现故障时，它会向 PostHog 发送一份错误报告：堆栈跟踪、你的浏览器、不带查询字符串的页面路径，以及（如果你已登录）你的 account ID。web 应用还会发送每个页面加载和响应所需的时间（web vitals），这仅是时间信息。<0>无论你是否接受 analytics cookies，web 应用都会发送错误报告和页面时间信息，</0>因为它们不会在你的设备上存储任何内容：它们仅在该页面内存中保留，当你离开页面时即消失。在我们的网站上，这两者都属于分析的一部分，并遵循你的 cookie 选择。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"When you are signed in, our servers also record the actions you take in Duct, such as starting a content plan or approving or applying a change, with your account ID. Your PostHog profile keeps your email address and name, so we can contact you about a problem you hit."
msgstr ""
"当你登录时，我们的服务器也会记录你在 Duct 中执行的操作，例如启动内容计划、批准或应用变更，并关联你的账户 ID。你的 PostHog 个人资料会保存你的电子邮件地址和姓名，以便我们可以在你遇到问题时联系你。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"When you use your own key, your usage is billed by that provider under your account and is subject to that provider's terms and privacy policy."
msgstr "当你使用自己的密钥时，你的使用量将由该提供商在你的账户下计费，并受该提供商的条款和隐私政策约束。"

#: privacy.html
msgid ""
"Where connected-source data is sent to an AI model provider, it is sent solely to produce the output you asked for. <0>We never use it to train models, and we never permit a provider to do so on our behalf.</0> Anthropic, OpenAI and Google are used under API terms that exclude submitted data from training by default."
msgstr ""
"当连接的源数据发送给 AI 模型提供商时，它仅用于生成你请求的输出。<0>我们绝不会将其用于训练模型，也绝不允许任何提供商代表我们这样做。</0> Anthropic、OpenAI 和 Google 均在 API 条款下使用，这些条款默认排除提交数据用于训练。"

