"An SEO audit reads the HTML. launch-check also reads the code behind it and checks what the page promises against what the product does. Search is one area of six. For a full crawl with keyword clusters and competitors, run Duct's free SEO audit."
msgstr ""
"SEO 审计只读取 HTML。launch-check 还会读取背后的代码，并对照产品实际功能核对页面承诺。搜索只是六个维度之一。如需包含关键词聚类和竞品分析的完整抓取，请运行 Duct 的免费 SEO 审计。"

#: skills.html
msgid "Answer engines"
msgstr "答案引擎"

#: skills.html
msgid ""
"Any agent the open skills CLI installs into: Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, OpenCode, Gemini CLI, GitHub Copilot, Windsurf and Zed among them. The skill is one SKILL.md folder in the Agent Skills format, so an agent that reads that format can use it without the installer."
msgstr ""
"支持开源 skills CLI 可安装的任何智能体：包括 Claude Code、Codex、Cursor、OpenCode、Gemini CLI、GitHub Copilot、Windsurf 和 Zed。该技能是符合 Agent Skills 格式的单个 SKILL.md 文件夹，因此支持该格式的智能体无需安装器即可直接使用。"

