msgstr "我需要打开代码仓库吗？"

#: skills.html
msgid "Does a shared link show a title, a description and an image?"
msgstr "分享的链接是否显示标题、描述和图片？"

#: skills.html
msgid "Does it send my site or my code to Duct?"
msgstr "它会把我的网站或代码发送给 Duct 吗？"

