msgstr "产品功能是否与页面及发布说明一致？"

#: skills.html
msgid ""
"Duct's MCP server lets the agent you just used list and read your Duct projects, and set one up from this repository. One address, one Allow in your browser. It can never approve a change."
msgstr ""
"Duct 的 MCP 服务器允许你刚才使用的智能体列出并读取你的 Duct 项目，并根据此代码仓库完成配置。一个地址，在浏览器中允许一次即可。它绝不能批准变更。"

#: skills.html
msgid ""
"Each area starts at 100. A FAIL costs 25 points and a WARN 10. Something it could not check costs nothing and is listed as unverified, so a missing repository lowers the confidence, not the score."
msgstr ""
"每个维度初始均为 100 分。FAIL 扣 25 分，WARN 扣 10 分。无法检查的项目不扣分并标为未验证，因此缺少仓库只会降低置信度，不会拉低分数。"

#: skills.html
msgid ""
"Every finding names the URL or the file and line it came from. What it could not see is marked unverified, never failed."
msgstr "每条发现都会标明来源 URL 或文件及行号。无法查看的内容会标记为未验证，绝不会算作失败。"

#: skills.html
msgid "First impression"
msgstr "第一印象"

#: skills.html
msgid ""
"Fix: no code. Read the release's download count from GitHub on launch day as the floor, and compare it with <0>download_started</0>."
msgstr ""
"修复方式：无需代码。在发布当天读取 GitHub 上的 Release 下载量作为基准底数，并与 <0>download_started</0> 进行比对。"

