msgstr "影响 2 · 难度 1 · 发现来源：代码仓库 · <0>site/assets/duct.js:364</0>"

#: skills.html
msgid ""
"In the EEA, UK and Switzerland, analytics load only after Accept, and <0>download_started</0> waits in a queue that is never sent for a visitor who ignores the banner. Launch-day downloads from Europe will read low."
msgstr ""
"在欧洲经济区、英国和瑞士，分析脚本仅在点击接受后加载，而对于忽略横幅的访客，<0>download_started</0> 会在队列中等待且永远不会发送。发布当天来自欧洲的下载量统计将会偏低。"

