msgid ""
"No sign-up, no API key, no Duct login. It uses your agent's own web and shell tools, and never signs up, logs in or submits a form anywhere."
msgstr "无需注册，无需 API 密钥，无需登录 Duct。它直接使用智能体自带的网络和 Shell 工具，绝不会在任何地方注册、登录或提交表单。"

#: skills.html
msgid ""
"No, but it is better with one. Without the code it checks the live pages only, and most of the measurement area comes back unverified rather than failed. The findings a page audit cannot give, like a download that sends no event, come from the repository."
msgstr ""
"不需要，但有代码仓库效果更好。没有代码时，它仅检查上线页面，大多数衡量领域会返回未验证而非失败。页面审计无法发现的问题（例如下载未发送事件）均来自于代码仓库。"

#: skills.html
msgid ""
"No. The skill is a set of instructions your agent follows with its own web and shell tools. There is no Duct server in the loop, no account and no API key. What your agent reads goes only where your agent's requests always go: to the model you already use."
msgstr ""
"不会。此技能是一组由你的智能体使用其自带网络和 Shell 工具执行的指令。流程中没有 Duct 服务器，无需账号，也没有 API 密钥。你的智能体读取的内容只会发送到它一贯请求的目标：你已经在使用的模型。"

#: skills.html
msgid ""
"Not without a yes. The one file it writes on its own is its report, <0>duct-launch-check.md</0>. Each fix comes as a diff and a question, one at a time. It never commits, pushes or deploys, and it never opens <1>.env</1> or key files."
msgstr ""
"未经确认不会更改。它自行写入的唯一文件是它的报告 <0>duct-launch-check.md</0>。每项修复都会依次以 Diff 和询问的形式呈现。它绝不会提交、推送或部署，也绝不会打开 <1>.env</1> 或密钥文件。"

#: skills.html
msgid ""
"Not without a yes. The one file it writes on its own is its report, duct-launch-check.md. Each fix comes as a diff and a question, one at a time. It never commits, pushes or deploys, and it never opens .env or key files."
