"Open-source skills for Claude Code, Codex, Cursor and any agent that reads SKILL.md. The first, launch-check, reads your live site and the code behind it, scores the launch out of 100 and ranks three fixes."
msgstr ""
"适用于 Claude Code、Codex、Cursor 以及任何支持 SKILL.md 智能体的开源技能。首个技能 launch-check 读取你的上线网站及其背后的代码，以 100 分制对发布打分，并对三项修复进行排序。"

