msgid ""
"The home page button says “Download for macOS” to Windows, Linux and phone visitors alike, because the per-platform label runs only on <0>/download</0>."
msgstr ""
"主页按钮对 Windows、Linux 和手机访客均显示“下载 macOS 版”，因为按平台显示标签的逻辑仅在 <0>/download</0> 上运行。"

#: skills.html
msgid ""
"The ones people ask for. Tell us the marketing job you would hand your agent in <0>GitHub Discussions</0>."
msgstr "大家最需要的技能。在 <0>GitHub Discussions</0> 中告诉我们你想交给智能体处理的营销任务。"

