"The ones people ask for. Tell us the marketing job you would hand your agent in GitHub Discussions."
msgstr "大家需要的那些。在 GitHub Discussions 中告诉我们你想交给智能体的营销任务。"

#: skills.html
msgid ""
"The skill is free and MIT licensed. It runs on your agent's own model, so a check costs what your agent spends reading ten pages and part of a repository. It stops at ten pages and aims to finish in ten minutes."
msgstr ""
"该技能免费且采用 MIT 许可证。它在你智能体自身的模型上运行，因此一次检查的成本仅取决于你的智能体阅读 10 个页面和部分代码仓库所消耗的费用。它最多检查 10 个页面，目标是在 10 分钟内完成。"

#: skills.html
msgid ""
"The skill is instructions, not a service. Your site and your code are read by your agent and go nowhere else. It never opens <0>.env</0> or key files."
msgstr "该技能是指令集，而非服务。你的网站和代码仅由你的智能体读取，绝不会传到别处。它绝不会打开 <0>.env</0> 或密钥文件。"

#: skills.html
msgid ""
"The skills CLI, which is open source and not ours, counts installs anonymously for the skills.sh leaderboard. Set <0>DISABLE_TELEMETRY=1</0> or <1>DO_NOT_TRACK=1</1> before you run it to turn that off. The skill itself sends nothing anywhere."
msgstr ""
"skills CLI 是开源的且不归我们所有，它会为 skills.sh 排行榜匿名统计安装量。在运行前设置 <0>DISABLE_TELEMETRY=1</0> 或 <1>DO_NOT_TRACK=1</1> 即可将其关闭。技能本身不会向任何地方发送数据。"

#: skills.html
msgid ""
"The skills CLI, which is open source and not ours, counts installs anonymously for the skills.sh leaderboard. Set DISABLE_TELEMETRY=1 or DO_NOT_TRACK=1 before you run it to turn that off. The skill itself sends nothing anywhere."
msgstr ""
"skills CLI 是开源的且不归我们所有，它会为 skills.sh 排行榜匿名统计安装量。在运行前设置 DISABLE_TELEMETRY=1 或 DO_NOT_TRACK=1 即可将其关闭。技能本身不会向任何地方发送数据。"

#: skills.html
msgid ""
"The three that matter most for launch day, each as a diff. It asks before every one and never commits, pushes or deploys."
msgstr "发布日最关键的三项，均以 diff 形式呈现。每项操作前都会询问，且绝不自动提交、推送或部署。"

