msgid ""
"Then ask your agent “Is my site ready to launch?”, or type <0>/launch-check</0> in Claude Code."
msgstr "然后向你的智能体提问“我的网站准备好上线了吗？”，或在 Claude Code 中输入 <0>/launch-check</0>。"

#: skills.html
msgid "Three fixes"
msgstr "三项修复"

#: skills.html
msgid ""
"Up to ten live pages, the sitemap and every card image, then the code behind them: the analytics tag, the signup or download event, where the head comes from, and the claims the page makes."
msgstr "最多 10 个线上页面、站点地图以及每张卡片图片，接着是它们背后的代码：分析代码标签、注册或下载事件、head 来源，以及页面陈述的内容。"

