#: skills.html
msgid ""
"getduct.ai and its repository, on November 10, 2026. Only two findings cleared the bar for a fix, and the first one exists only in the code: downloads from Europe would read low, with nothing on the page to show it."
msgstr ""
"2026 年 11 月 10 日的 getduct.ai 及其代码仓库。只有两项发现达到了修复门槛，且第一项仅存在于代码中：来自欧洲的下载量读数偏低，而页面上没有任何迹象表明这一点。"

#: skills.html
msgid ""
"launch-check tells you whether the launch will be counted. Duct, the open-source AI marketing agent this shelf comes from, tells you what the count means."
msgstr "launch-check 会告诉你发布是否被统计。Duct（此技能架所属的开源 AI 营销智能体）则会告诉你这些统计数字意味着什么。"

#: skills.html
msgid ""
"npx skills update brings it to the latest version, and npx skills remove launch-check takes it out. The install goes into the project you run it in; add -g to make it available in every project. The CLI needs Node.js 22.20 or later."
msgstr ""
"运行 npx skills update 可更新至最新版本，运行 npx skills remove launch-check 可将其移除。安装会作用于你当前运行它的项目；添加 -g 可使其在所有项目中可用。该 CLI 需要 Node.js 22.20 或更高版本。"

