#: tools/weekly-brief-template.html
msgid "<0>What are we doing about it?</0> — one action, one owner, one deadline"
msgstr "<0>我们该怎么做？</0>——一个行动，一个负责人，一个截止日期"

#: tools/weekly-brief-template.html
msgid ""
"<0>What happened?</0> — one paragraph, north star metric plus 2–3 supporting signals"
msgstr "<0>发生了什么？</0>——一段话，北极星指标加上 2–3 个支持信号"

#: tools/weekly-brief-template.html
msgid ""
"<0>Why did it happen?</0> — the cross-tool pattern that explains the movement"
msgstr "<0>为什么会发生？</0>——解释变化的跨工具模式"

#: tools/weekly-brief-template.html
msgid ""
"A brief is only as useful as the baselines behind it. If you don't already know your key metric benchmarks, calculate them first — then fill in the template with confidence. <0>Related calculators below</0> can help."
msgstr "简报的有用性取决于其背后的基线。如果你还不知道你的关键指标基准，请先计算它们——然后自信地填写模板。<0>下方相关计算器</0>可以提供帮助。"

#: tools/weekly-brief-template.html
msgid "A good weekly brief answers three questions:"
msgstr "一份好的每周简报回答三个问题："

#: tools/weekly-brief-template.html
msgid ""
"A report shows what happened — raw numbers, charts, tables. A brief tells you what it means and what to do. A good weekly marketing brief has a north star metric, the two or three signals that explain its movement, and one clear action. If your brief requires someone to interpret it, it's a report, not a brief."
msgstr ""
"报告显示发生了什么——原始数据、图表、表格。简报告诉你这意味着什么以及该怎么做。一份好的每周营销简报应包含一个北极星指标、解释其变化的两个或三个信号，以及一个明确的行动。如果你的简报需要有人解读，那它就是一份报告，而不是简报。"

#: tools/weekly-brief-template.html
msgid ""
"A template tells you how to write a brief. It doesn't tell you what changed this week."
msgstr "模板告诉你如何撰写简报。它不会告诉你本周发生了什么变化。"

#: tools/weekly-brief-template.html
msgid ""
"A weekly marketing brief should include: your north star metric and whether it moved, 2–3 channel-level metrics for each tool in your stack, one anomaly or unexpected change, and a single priority action for the coming week. Keep it under one page — if it requires scrolling it won't get read."
msgstr ""
"每周营销简报应包括：你的北极星指标及其变化情况，你的工具栈中每个工具的 2–3 个渠道级指标，一个异常或意外变化，以及未来一周的一个优先行动。保持在一页以内——如果需要滚动，就不会有人阅读。"

#: tools/weekly-brief-template.html
msgid "Ahrefs"
msgstr "Ahrefs"

#: tools/weekly-brief-template.html
msgid "Before you fill this in"
msgstr "在你填写之前"

#: tools/weekly-brief-template.html
msgid "Choose your tools →"
msgstr "选择你的工具 →"

#. button aria-label
#: tools/weekly-brief-template.html
msgid "Copy brief template to clipboard"
msgstr "复制简报模板到剪贴板"

#: tools/weekly-brief-template.html
msgid ""
"Copy the template and paste it into your preferred tool — Notion, Google Docs, Slack, or wherever your team reads updates. Fill in the metric slots by pulling data from each tool. Write 1–2 sentences of interpretation per section — what changed and what it means. The priority action section is the most important: one thing, one owner, one week."
msgstr ""
"复制模板并将其粘贴到你偏好的工具中——Notion、Google Docs、Slack，或你的团队阅读更新的任何地方。通过从每个工具中提取数据来填写指标槽。每个部分撰写 1–2 句解释——发生了什么变化以及这意味着什么。优先行动部分最重要：一件事，一个负责人，一周内完成。"

#: tools/weekly-brief-template.html
msgid "Copy to clipboard"
msgstr "复制到剪贴板"

#: tools/weekly-brief-template.html
msgid ""
"Duct reads your actual tools, writes the brief with what changed, why, and one action, and remembers what you decided last week."
msgstr "Duct 读取你的实际工具，撰写包含变化、原因和一个行动的简报，并记住你上周的决定。"

#: tools/weekly-brief-template.html
msgid ""
"Free interactive tool that generates a customised weekly marketing report template based on your role (Growth PM, Performance Marketer, SEO Lead) and tool stack (GA4, Mixpanel, HubSpot, Google Ads, Ahrefs, Search Console, Meta Ads, LinkedIn Ads)."
msgstr ""
"免费的交互式工具，可根据你的角色 (增长产品经理、效果营销人员、SEO 负责人) 和工具栈 (GA4, Mixpanel, HubSpot, Google Ads, Ahrefs, Search Console, Meta Ads, LinkedIn Ads) 生成定制的每周营销报告模板。"

#. meta description
#: tools/weekly-brief-template.html
msgid ""
"Free weekly marketing brief template generator. Pick your role and tool stack and get a customised weekly report template in seconds. No signup required."
msgstr "免费每周营销简报模板生成器。选择你的角色和工具栈，即可在几秒钟内获得定制的每周报告模板。无需注册。"

#. meta twitter:description
#: tools/weekly-brief-template.html
msgid ""
"Generate a customised weekly marketing brief template for your role and tool stack. Free, instant, no signup."
msgstr "为你的角色和工具栈生成定制的每周营销简报模板。免费、即时、无需注册。"

#: tools/weekly-brief-template.html
msgid "Generate my brief template →"
msgstr "生成我的简报模板 →"

#. div aria-label
#: tools/weekly-brief-template.html
msgid "Generated brief template"
msgstr "已生成的简报模板"

#. meta og:description
#: tools/weekly-brief-template.html
msgid ""
"Get a customised weekly marketing report template for your exact tool stack. Free, instant, copy with one click."
msgstr "获取为你精确工具栈定制的每周营销报告模板。免费、即时、一键复制。"

#: tools/weekly-brief-template.html
msgid ""
"Ground your brief in real benchmarks—then automate the weekly synthesis. These calculators use the same in-browser, privacy-first model as this template."
msgstr "将你的简报建立在真实基准之上——然后自动化每周的综合分析。这些计算器使用与此模板相同的浏览器内、隐私优先模型。"

#: tools/weekly-brief-template.html
msgid "How long does a weekly marketing brief take to write?"
msgstr "撰写一份每周营销简报需要多长时间？"

#: tools/weekly-brief-template.html
msgid "How to use this template"
msgstr "如何使用此模板"

#: tools/weekly-brief-template.html
msgid ""
"Include only the tools that directly affect your north star metric this week. For most growth teams: GA4 for traffic and conversion, one ad platform for paid spend, and either Mixpanel or HubSpot for downstream pipeline or product behaviour. More than four tools in a weekly brief usually means no clear north star."
msgstr ""
"只包含本周直接影响你北极星指标的工具。对于大多数增长团队：GA4 用于流量和转化，一个广告平台用于付费支出，以及 Mixpanel 或 HubSpot 用于下游销售线索或产品行为。每周简报中超过四个工具通常意味着没有明确的北极星指标。"

#: tools/weekly-brief-template.html
msgid "Leave blank to use a placeholder you can fill in later."
msgstr "留空以使用稍后可填写的占位符。"

#: tools/weekly-brief-template.html
msgid "LinkedIn Ads"
msgstr "LinkedIn Ads"

#: tools/weekly-brief-template.html
msgid "Metric slots are placeholders. Pull actuals from each tool before sharing."
msgstr "指标槽是占位符。分享前请从每个工具中提取实际数据。"

#: tools/weekly-brief-template.html
msgid ""
"Most growth marketers and PMs spend 2–3 hours per week writing a weekly brief manually — pulling data from GA4, HubSpot, Mixpanel, and ad platforms separately, then synthesising it into a coherent narrative. With a good template this reduces to 60–90 minutes. With automation, it takes minutes."
msgstr ""
"大多数增长营销人员和产品经理每周花费 2–3 小时手动撰写每周简报——分别从 GA4、HubSpot、Mixpanel 和广告平台提取数据，然后将其综合成一个连贯的叙述。使用好的模板可将时间缩短到 60–90 分钟。通过自动化，只需几分钟。"

#: tools/weekly-brief-template.html
msgid ""
"Most weekly marketing reports fail for the same reason: they're data dumps, not briefs. They show every number from every tool without telling anyone what it means or what to do about it."
msgstr "大多数每周营销报告失败的原因相同：它们是数据堆砌，而非简报。它们展示了每个工具的每个数字，却没有告诉任何人这意味着什么或该如何处理。"

#: tools/weekly-brief-template.html
msgid "North star"
msgstr "北极星"

#. input aria-label
#: tools/weekly-brief-template.html
msgid "North star metric"
msgstr "北极星指标"

#: tools/weekly-brief-template.html
msgid "Organic traffic, keyword rankings, content performance"
msgstr "自然流量、关键词排名、内容表现"

#: tools/weekly-brief-template.html
msgid "Paid acquisition, ROAS, CAC, pipeline from paid channels"
msgstr "付费获客，ROAS，CAC，付费渠道的销售线索"

#: tools/weekly-brief-template.html
msgid "Product-led growth, activation, retention, feature adoption"
msgstr "产品主导增长、激活、留存、功能采用"

#: tools/weekly-brief-template.html
msgid "SEO Lead"
msgstr "SEO 负责人"

#: tools/weekly-brief-template.html
msgid "Select all that apply — your brief will include the right metrics for each."
msgstr "选择所有适用项——你的简报将包含每个项的正确指标。"

#: tools/weekly-brief-template.html
msgid "Select at least one tool to continue."
msgstr "至少选择一个工具以继续。"

#: tools/weekly-brief-template.html
msgid "Set your north star →"
msgstr "设置你的北极星 →"

#: tools/weekly-brief-template.html
msgid ""
"The interpretation sections require human judgment — the template structures the question, not the answer."
msgstr "解读部分需要人工判断——模板构建问题，而非答案。"

#: tools/weekly-brief-template.html
msgid ""
"The single number that defines a good week. Your brief will centre on whether it moved — and why."
msgstr "定义一周表现的单一数字。你的简报将围绕它是否变化以及为何变化展开。"

#: tools/weekly-brief-template.html
msgid "The template is written. The question is who fills it every week."
msgstr "模板已写好。问题是谁每周填写它。"

#: tools/weekly-brief-template.html
msgid ""
"The template this tool generates is structured around these three questions, with sections customised for your exact tool stack. It's designed to take 60–90 minutes to fill manually — or zero minutes with Duct."
msgstr "此工具生成的模板围绕这三个问题构建，各部分根据你的确切工具栈进行定制。它旨在手动填写需 60–90 分钟——或使用 Duct 零分钟。"

#: tools/weekly-brief-template.html
msgid ""
"This template is a starting point — adapt the sections to your specific context and team norms."
msgstr "此模板是一个起点——请根据你的具体情况和团队规范调整各部分。"

#: tools/weekly-brief-template.html
msgid "Tool stack"
msgstr "工具栈"

